You won't be a murderer; if the priest is cross-aligned, 
your god is even proud of you.  So, no bad consequences 
if you kill him/her.  However, attacking him/her might 
yield undesirable consequences, since his/her deity might 
interfere.  If you are inside the sanctum, that is.  

