> Are there any other methods besides
> killing to deal with the priest? 

Two untested ideas (try in wizmode first):  One way is to try and 
teleport him (first run around and lock every lockable door) until 
he gets caught in a room (use telepathy to check, and zap him/her 
from outside the sanctum).  Second idea is just to dig holes and 
wait for him/her to fall in (they have a very small cruising range).  
A third idea would be to polymorph him/her, hoping for a harmless 
monster as a result, but that's really risky (and he'll have some 
resistances to that, I suppose).  I also managed to kill him/her 
once from outside using a wand of cold (IIRC), but in retrospect 
I think that's a quite uncertain method since he can heal himself 
quite well.  

Just another idea:  If there's a digging dwarf on the level, 
you can try and wait for it to produce lots of boulders.  You 
could then insulate the priest with boulders (no idea if that 
works), then pepper him/her with darts/daggers/wands/whatever.  
But keep out of the sanctum while attacking.  

If you try one of those ideas, report whether they work; by the 
time I can do wizmode testing, I will already have forgotten 
these ideas ;-).  

